          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "أرجوحة — urjūḥa — \"a swing\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "يلعب الأطفال على الأرجوحة في الحديقة. yalʿabu al-aṭfāl ʿalā al-urjūḥa fī al-ḥadīqa. The children play on the swing in the park."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: أراجيح, arājīḥ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "أرجوحة (urjūḥa) is built on the native Arabic root r-j-ḥ, \"to outweigh, to go down (of a scale)\" (Lane). A swing goes up and down like the pans of a scale."
            }
          ]
        },
